<title>UK: DSL Bank sets 2.0 billion lux franc Dec 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Bank sets 2.0 billion lux franc Dec 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Banque et Caisse d'Epargne de l'&quot;Etat and</p>
<p>Banque Generale du Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.125     MATURITY    27.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.55    PAY DATE  S 27.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     YIELD	4.60 PCT  S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> IBCA	 AAA	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 PRAECIPUUM 0.25</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR DEBT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
